    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Deux couples, Pierre et Aim\u00e9e, et Eric et P\u00e9n\u00e9lope, partagent tous les quatre plusieurs ann\u00e9es d'amiti\u00e9 sans nuage. Seul souci, P\u00e9n\u00e9lope et Pierre sont devenus amants... La situation devenant intenable, ils d\u00e9cident de rompre. Mais apr\u00e8s une ultime nuit d'amour passionn\u00e9e, le sort leur joue un tour : Pierre et P\u00e9n\u00e9lope se r\u00e9veillent chacun dans le corps de l'autre ! Pour prot\u00e9ger leur secret, ils se retrouvent chacun \u00e0 devoir vivre la vie de l'autre. C'est le d\u00e9but des complications...",
        "english": "For several years, two couples, Pierre and Aim\u00e9e, and Eric and P\u00e9n\u00e9lope, have enjoyed a warm and solid friendship. The only problem: P\u00e9n\u00e9lope and Pierre have become lovers... The situation has become impossible and they decide to break up. But after a final passionate night of lovemaking, fate plays a trick on them: Pierre and P\u00e9n\u00e9lope wake up in each other's bodies. To protect their secret, they are each obliged to live each other's life. Things are going to get complicated..."
